hello! welcome to T-Minus! T- is a langugage that is interpreted in Python,
here are some commands you can use in this alpha:

ms "text"
      - shows text (like a print())

nl_
  - jump a line, or makes a paragraph

neofetch
      - as a reference to the famous "neofetch" command on linux, this commands
        works showing a ASCII art of T-, and about

-help
    - shows commands

